{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-07-29 15:00:00', 'title': 'LILLY RELEASES DONANEMAB DATA THAT DEMONSTRATED RELATIONSHIP BETWEEN REDUCTION OF AMYLOID PLAQUE AND SLOWING OF COGNITIVE DECLINE', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, JULY 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY AT THE ALZHEIMER'S ASSOCIATION INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE© (AAIC© 2021), ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) PRESENTED TWO NEW EXPLORATORY ANALYSES OF DATA FROM THE PHASE 2 TRAILBLAZER-ALZ STUDY. IN THE FIRST, GREATER AMYLOID PLAQUE CHANGES FOLLOWING DONANEMAB TREATMENT WAS HIGHLY ASSOCIATED WITH LESS COGNITIVE DECLINE AND PARTICIPANTS WITH GREATER PLAQUE CLEARANCE AT 24 WEEKS OF TREATMENT SHOWED LESS TAU PROGRESSION."}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-07-29 06:45:00', 'title': 'LILLY AND KUMQUAT BIOSCIENCES ANNOUNCE COLLABORATION TO DISCOVER AND DEVELOP NOVEL SMALL MOLECULES THAT STIMULATE TUMOR-SPECIFIC IMMUNE RESPONSES', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS AND SAN DIEGO, JULY 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LOXO ONCOLOGY AT LILLY, A RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT GROUP OF ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY),\xa0AND KUMQUAT BIOSCIENCES TODAY ANNOUNCED AN EXCLUSIVE COLLABORATION FOCUSED ON THE DISCOVERY, DEVELOPMENT AND COMMERCIALIZATION OF POTENTIAL NOVEL SMALL MOLECULES\xa0THAT STIMULATE TUMOR-SPECIFIC IMMUNE RESPONSES. THROUGH THE MULTI-YEAR COLLABORATION, KUMQUAT WILL UTILIZE ITS SMALL MOLECULE IMMUNO-ONCOLOGY (IO)\xa0PLATFORM TO DISCOVER NOVEL CLINICAL CANDIDATES AND LILLY HAS THE OPTION TO SELECT\xa0A\xa0CERTAIN NUMBER OF DRUG CANDIDATES FOR FURTHER DEVELOPMENT AND COMMERCIALIZATION WORLDWIDE, EXCLUDING GREATER CHINA.'}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-07-29 15:00:00', 'title': 'LILLY RELEASES DONANEMAB DATA THAT DEMONSTRATED RELATIONSHIP BETWEEN REDUCTION OF AMYLOID PLAQUE AND SLOWING OF COGNITIVE DECLINE', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, JULY 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY AT THE ALZHEIMER'S ASSOCIATION INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE© (AAIC© 2021), ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) PRESENTED TWO NEW EXPLORATORY ANALYSES OF DATA FROM THE PHASE 2 TRAILBLAZ